	(text "Columns: 74HC595 chain from VLOGIC (COL_DAT -> SER, QH' -> next SER), 8 columns per register, COL2ROW.\nLED driver(s): IS31FL3741A from LED_5V (off by default); PCA9306 opens the I2C bus to them only while LED_5V\nis on (EN tied to VREF2), so an unpowered driver never loads the shared bus. Descriptor EEPROM at 0x50."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
